{"schemaVersion":2,"bookId":"mackay-information-theory-2003","title":"关于第 50 章","sourcePdfPages":[600,600],"toc":[{"number":"50-intro","title":"关于第 50 章","block":"p600-b001"}],"blocks":[{"pdfPage":600,"page":1,"kind":"heading","level":1,"text":"关于第 50 章","segments":["关于第 50 章"],"id":"p600-b001","html":"<h1 style=\"border-top:3px solid currentColor;padding-top:.65em;text-align:center;font-style:italic\">关于第 50 章</h1>"},{"pdfPage":600,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"下面这道习题有助于理解数字喷泉码的背景。","segments":["下面这道习题有助于理解数字喷泉码的背景。"],"id":"p600-b002"},{"pdfPage":600,"page":1,"kind":"exercise","label":"▷ 习题 50.1","text":"（难度 3）一位作者通过随机抽查页面来校对自己那本共有 $K=700$ 页的书。他进行了 $N$ 次页面检查，却没有采取任何措施避免重复检查同一页。","segments":["（难度 3）一位作者通过随机抽查页面来校对自己那本共有 ",{"tex":"K=700","text":"K=700","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>700</mn></mrow></math>"}," 页的书。他进行了 ",{"tex":"N","text":"N","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></math>"}," 次页面检查，却没有采取任何措施避免重复检查同一页。"],"id":"p600-b003"},{"pdfPage":600,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"(a) 检查 $N=K$ 次后，预计有多大比例的页面从未被检查过？","segments":["(a) 检查 ",{"tex":"N=K","text":"N=K","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></math>"}," 次后，预计有多大比例的页面从未被检查过？"],"id":"p600-b004"},{"pdfPage":600,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"(b) 检查 $N>K$ 次后，仍有一页或多页从未被检查过的概率是多少？","segments":["(b) 检查 ",{"tex":"N>K","text":"N>K","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></math>"}," 次后，仍有一页或多页从未被检查过的概率是多少？"],"id":"p600-b005"},{"pdfPage":600,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"(c) 证明：要使全部 $K$ 页均已检查过的概率达到 $1-\\delta$，所需的页面检查次数约为 $N\\simeq K\\ln(K/\\delta)$。","segments":["(c) 证明：要使全部 ",{"tex":"K","text":"K","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow></math>"}," 页均已检查过的概率达到 ",{"tex":"1-\\delta","text":"1-\\delta","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></math>"},"，所需的页面检查次数约为 ",{"tex":"N\\simeq K\\ln(K/\\delta)","text":"N\\simeq K\\ln(K/\\delta)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≃</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"。"],"id":"p600-b006"},{"pdfPage":600,"page":1,"kind":"paragraph","text":"[这道题通常表述为：把 $N$ 个球随机投进 $K$ 个箱子，每个箱子至少得到一个球的概率是多少？]","segments":["[这道题通常表述为：把 ",{"tex":"N","text":"N","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></math>"}," 个球随机投进 ",{"tex":"K","text":"K","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow></math>"}," 个箱子，每个箱子至少得到一个球的概率是多少？]"],"id":"p600-b007"}]}